  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida intend to support the financing of a project for rehabilitation  of sewers in the town of Mtskheta in Mtskheta-Mtianeti Region and     capacity building of a stff in handling the treatment plant and       office. The project schedule is March 28th 2012-31st of December      2013. Sida&apos;s proposed contribution is SEK 11 million.</narrative>
